{
  "what": "The declared block-fold split: the shape measurement's six (file, language) cells re-measured with the mapped set, streams, seeds, machinery, restarts, sweep cap, plants, floors and band unchanged, the leave-one-out table carried forward, and the declared split replaced by the contiguous block fold, so the score half is fresh to the search in the span sense and not only the pair sense. The bridge gate re-derived the shape measurement under the parity split through this measurement's code before the block cells ran. The declared truthful question: does the real's held-out score-half value still stand above the band when the scored pairs are fresh to the search in the span sense - a yes extends the separation beyond the parity geometry, a no records that the margin was carried by the parity geometry's interleaving. No mapping is published; nothing here is a reading.",
  "declared": {
    "base_seed": 20261020,
    "mapped": 36,
    "restarts": 16,
    "sweep_cap": 200,
    "plants_per_cell": 5,
    "floors": 5,
    "split_rule": "the counted pairs of each side, in stream order, split into contiguous blocks at the midpoint: the first floor(N/2) pairs the climb half the machinery may search, the remaining pairs the score half it may never touch; for an odd count the climb half takes the smaller first block; the halves share no counted pair and every identity anchor's halves fold by the same rule; deterministic, consuming no seed",
    "loo_rule": "the shape measurement's leave-one-out table carried forward unchanged: the inherited add-one form is log((n_ab + 1) / (N + 729)) with N the reference stream's total counted pairs; every pair type (a, b) present in the reference pair table is scored with one occurrence of (a, b) removed from the reference counts, log(n_ab / (N + 728)), and a type with no counted occurrence keeps the inherited add-one entry log(1 / (N + 729)); the letter marginals and rank initialisation unchanged, the matrix arithmetic needing no re-derivation as the shape measurement declared",
    "measured_facts_rule": "the mapped set, streams, seeds, machinery, restarts, sweep cap, plants, floors and band are the held-out screen's and shape measurement's declarations replayed unchanged; the encodings and shuffles are byte-identical replays of the frozen measurement's draws and only the split changes; each side's exact full-data side call is recorded beside its held-out value for attribution only",
    "machinery_rule": "unchanged from the held-out screen: the exact greedy reassignment climb on the climb half, exact pricing on the score half, restart 0 the rank initialisation from the climb half, restarts 1 onward the seeded permutations of the 27 letter tokens under the wrap rule, the best restart the best exact climb-half total with ties to the first; no assignment is stored",
    "seed_kinds": {
      "real": 1,
      "homo_plant": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "homo_floor": [
        26,
        27
      ],
      "homo_cross": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    "seed_sharing": "no new seed kinds are consumed; the declared draws are replayed from the declared kinds and this measurement consumes none of any other module's declared draws",
    "bridge_gate": "before the block-fold cells run, the block instrument's full first cell (ZL english: the real, its five plants, its five floors and its three band members) is computed through this measurement's code under the inherited pair-index-parity split and compared field for field against the shape measurement's own outputs; any divergence aborts with nothing written",
    "band_record_rule": "membership, selection, ties and spreads are declared unchanged from the held-out screen (a member's band value the held-out value of the draw whose exact climb-half total is best, strict beyond 1e-12, ties to the first draw); each member records draws_climb_exact, its five climb-half totals at full precision, so the declared selection is re-derivable from the stored artifact",
    "verdict_rule": "unchanged from the held-out screen and applied to the block-fold-scale numbers: the real held-out at or above the smallest member band value is consistent-with-substitution, at or below the largest floor's held-out value is not-consistent, strictly between is below-held-band; the strings describe consistency under this artifact's declared split and do not restate the parity split's verdicts",
    "margin_rule": "the margin is computed from the stored rounded values: the real held-out mean minus the smallest member band value, rounded to four decimals",
    "exclusion_rule": "the family's declared exclusion format is not re-scoped by this artifact: it keys to the declared 36-slot class under the inherited add-one form exactly as the held-out screen declared it, so a block-fold verdict is split-geometry evidence and the shape measurement's verdicts stand untouched by this artifact's numbers",
    "truthful_question": "declared in advance: does the real's held-out score-half value still stand above the band when the scored pairs are fresh to the search in the span sense, not only the pair sense - a yes extends the separation beyond the parity geometry, a no records that the margin was carried by the parity geometry's interleaving",
